<00:00:00.087>My <00:00:00.196>landing <00:00:00.489>did <00:00:00.609>not <00:00:00.772>go <00:00:00.870>to <00:00:00.935>plan. <00:00:01.641>In <00:00:01.761>April <00:00:02.522>1967 <00:00:03.130>I <00:00:03.250>came <00:00:03.511>down <00:00:03.783>toward <00:00:03.989>the <00:00:04.087>Ocean <00:00:04.370>of <00:00:04.457>Storms, <00:00:05.207>and <00:00:05.293>my <00:00:05.446>engines <00:00:05.750>were <00:00:05.848>supposed <00:00:06.239>to <00:00:06.304>switch <00:00:06.620>off <00:00:07.022>just <00:00:07.228>above <00:00:07.457>the <00:00:07.522>ground. <00:00:08.272>They <00:00:08.337>didn't. <00:00:08.978>I <00:00:09.043>touched <00:00:09.348>down, <00:00:10.000>bounced <00:00:10.283>back <00:00:10.522>up, <00:00:10.924>touched <00:00:11.217>down, <00:00:11.870>bounced <00:00:12.163>again, <00:00:12.750>and <00:00:12.859>finally <00:00:13.272>settled <00:00:13.587>on <00:00:13.685>the <00:00:13.761>third <00:00:14.033>try. <00:00:14.739>I <00:00:14.826>ended <00:00:15.000>up <00:00:15.120>inside <00:00:15.413>a <00:00:15.457>crater.
